Third-party data
----------------

The timetable, station and fare data in
SEPTACommute/MetroKit/Data/GeneratedSEPTAData.swift is derived from the
Southeastern Pennsylvania Transportation Authority's published GTFS feed:

    https://github.com/septadev/GTFS

That data is SEPTA's, not the author's, and the copyright notice above does not
extend to it. It is used under SEPTA's developer licence:

    https://www.septa.org/license-agreement/

SEPTA's name, the names of its lines and routes, and its line colours are used
here to describe its services. This project is not affiliated with, endorsed by,
or supported by SEPTA.
